      "greedy": {
        "desc": "Motivated by coin, treasures, and material advantage. Easily swayed by bribes, offended by low payments.",
        "tells": [
          "Eyes flicker immediately to your purse and gear.",
          "Fingers tap a coin rhythm against their belt or weapon guard.",
          "Counts carried coin under their breath while listening."
